    "title": "Thunderstorms forming could bring gusty winds this evening - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Post Register\nwebsite\nBoise\nThunderstorms forming could bring gusty winds this evening\nBy Roland Steadham - Chief Meteorologist,\n5 hours agoCBS2 Boise — Even though we've had lots of sunshine today, a trough of low pressure is still moving in from Oregon. This will bring some scattered thunderstorms to Western Idaho this evening. However, the primary concern will be the potential for pockets of gusty winds that could exceed 50 mph at times. Not all areas will see this, but these downbursts of wind can create some blowing dust and sand. The weather will be sunny on Thursday with highs cooling into the mid 80's. Sunny and hotter conditions will return on Saturday and Sunday.\n7",
